# Salesforce DX ignore file.
# Generated agent artefacts. `sf agent publish authoring-bundle` writes these
# into the project. Salesforce will not redeploy an active bot version, so a
# full force-app deploy fails if they are included. The source of truth is the
# authoring bundle in aiAuthoringBundles/; publish it with `sf agent publish`.
**/bots/**
**/genAiPlannerBundles/**

# Standard ignores
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
**/__tests__/**
package.xml
